    "description": "The Waitlist Management API allows users to access and manage waitlist information for event tickets within the ticketing system. This endpoint provides insights into the current waitlist status for specific events, enabling event organizers and ticketing managers to monitor demand and allocate tickets efficiently. Typical consumers include event coordinators, sales teams, and customer support agents who require real-time visibility into ticket availability. This API enhances operational efficiency by facilitating informed decision-making around ticket sales and customer engagement.",
